  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS BANGKOK 2022-MAE TAO CLINIC BANGKOK V22</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The providing HIV screening and support services to the vulnerable and displaced population along the Thailand-Burma border, implemented by Mae Tao Clinic aims to contribute to collaboration with Thai public health to improve access to clinical specialty services at Thai government health facilities. The objectives of the grant are to improve access to essential services by addressing specific social determinants of health such as poverty, lack of knowledge on health and available services, language barriers, lack of legal documentation and lack of social support to facilitate access to more advanced care at government hospitals in both Thailand and Myanmar.</narrative>
  </description>
